0096 | \markright{UNLIKELY INTERSECTIONS AND THE CHABAUTY--KIM METHOD}
0097 | \begin{abstract}
0098 | We extend some results known for the Chabauty--Kim method over $\Q $ to the case of general number fields. The main new result is an unlikely intersection theorem for zeroes of iterated integrals on subvarieties of products of curves.
0099 | \end{abstract}
